had suffered because of the warlords.

251
00:15:17,360 --> 00:15:20,040
King Nefertari Cobra of Alabasta,

252
00:15:20,680 --> 00:15:23,440
and Rick Doldo III of Dressrosa.

253
00:15:23,700 --> 00:15:26,440
They led a heartfelt
argument at the reverie.

254
00:15:27,260 --> 00:15:30,940
The abolition of the Seven
Warlords system was their solution.

255
00:15:31,320 --> 00:15:35,060
The matter was put to a
majority vote and passed.

256
00:15:36,660 --> 00:15:40,660
As of this day, you no longer have
any ties to the world government.

257
00:15:40,840 --> 00:15:43,237
All of your privileges
and rights as one of the

258
00:15:43,320 --> 00:15:45,937
Seven Warlords have been
immediately revoked.

259
00:15:46,020 --> 00:15:47,160
Is that clear?

260
00:15:48,660 --> 00:15:50,900
Buggy, I know you're there.

261
00:15:51,260 --> 00:15:53,440
You're nothing but a pirate again.

262
00:15:54,380 --> 00:15:56,480
Oh, is any of this crap fair, huh?

263
00:15:56,800 --> 00:16:00,677
First you declare me a warlord, then
you trick me around and take it away?

264
00:16:00,760 --> 00:16:03,257
And now you want to arrest
me because you morons were

265
00:16:03,340 --> 00:16:06,457
dumb enough to be scammed
by Crocodile and Doflamingo?

266
00:16:06,540 --> 00:16:08,357
That has nothing to do with me!

267
00:16:08,440 --> 00:16:10,820
Do you imbeciles even hear yourselves?

268
00:16:11,360 --> 00:16:13,536
They have the whole coast surrounded.

269
00:16:13,860 --> 00:16:15,540
We got a plan, boss?

270
00:16:17,100 --> 00:16:20,520
These buzzkills are
screwing up my life plans!

271
00:16:20,880 --> 00:16:22,240
What's going on here?

272
00:16:22,480 --> 00:16:25,637
I thought the Navy was supposed
to be on our side, though.

273
00:16:25,720 --> 00:16:27,544
What do you think we should do?

274
00:16:28,260 --> 00:16:29,840
Hey, Mommy!

275
00:16:32,100 --> 00:16:34,865
Surrender yourself at
once, Hawkeye and Mihawk!

276
00:16:35,520 --> 00:16:37,020
Let's get this over with!

277
00:16:38,860 --> 00:16:41,560
Snake Princess, we have a situation.

278
00:16:42,260 --> 00:16:46,637
There's been a report your title as a
warlord of the sea has been ripped away.

279
00:16:46,720 --> 00:16:47,820
Granny Magellan!

280
00:16:48,480 --> 00:16:51,640
Navy ships are approaching
fast! Huh? Already?

281
00:16:51,920 --> 00:16:53,480
This surely means trouble.

282
00:16:54,180 --> 00:16:56,062
No, but that doesn't seem right.

283
00:16:57,940 --> 00:16:59,140
Snake princess.

284
00:16:59,540 --> 00:17:01,180
We have the advantage.

285
00:17:03,260 --> 00:17:04,380
They've forgotten.

286
00:17:05,180 --> 00:17:07,680
We're in it deep, Chairman Buggy.

287
00:17:08,020 --> 00:17:09,317
Should we try to run?

288
00:17:09,400 --> 00:17:11,220
Of course not!

289
00:17:11,400 --> 00:17:14,400
We are going to give them
the fight of their lives!

290
00:17:18,720 --> 00:17:20,560
It's time to get flashy!

291
00:17:22,440 --> 00:17:23,640
You cowards!

292
00:17:25,640 --> 00:17:27,680
That's what's happening for ya!

293
00:17:29,420 --> 00:17:33,060
Boggy! Boggy! Boggy! Boggy!

294
00:17:33,240 --> 00:17:36,540
Of cleansing us will be the
last mistake you ever make!

295
00:17:36,700 --> 00:17:38,582
You can't say I didn't warn you!

296
00:17:40,360 --> 00:17:41,190
Weevil!

297
00:17:41,273 --> 00:17:42,840
Approval to give them hell!

298
00:17:43,260 --> 00:17:44,260
Oh yeah, Mommy?

299
00:17:44,560 --> 00:17:46,860
I'm gonna rip them apart then!

300
00:17:49,060 --> 00:17:52,440
In the name of Whitebeard,
I'll stop all of you!

301
00:17:52,940 --> 00:17:55,100
I feel a shudder of excitement.

302
00:17:55,540 --> 00:17:57,300
It's been a long time.

303
00:17:58,860 --> 00:18:01,760
I suppose I'm the one being chased now.

304
00:18:03,920 --> 00:18:07,449
There's a good reason why we
were chosen to become warlords.

305
00:18:10,000 --> 00:18:11,377
Because we're powerful.

306
00:18:11,460 --> 00:18:12,519
Overwhelmingly so.

307
00:18:13,000 --> 00:18:15,197
I'll be counting on you guys, all right?

308
00:18:15,280 --> 00:18:17,280
Show them what we're made of.

309
00:18:19,820 --> 00:18:22,300
While I get the hell out of here!
